{"id":"893e72411706379e","group":"68","path":"68/68-thm-finite-injury-method.md","title":"Finite Injury Method","display":"thm-finite-injury-method — Finite Injury Method","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-thm-finite-injury-method","aliases":["68-thm-finite-injury-method"],"display":"thm-finite-injury-method — Finite Injury Method","depends_on":["[[68-df-finite-injury-compatibility]]","[[68-df-finite-injury]]","[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]"],"source_location":"not a theorem stated in supplied PDF; local verification lemma inspired by §15.5","verification_status":"local-conditional-lemma-proved","source_proof_status":"local-induction-reviewed","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_basis":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-thm-finite-injury-method"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-thm-finite-injury-method</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-injury-method — Finite Injury Method"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0d2eafa7efbe1e51\" href=\"?note=0d2eafa7efbe1e51\" title=\"68-df-finite-injury-compatibility\">68-df-finite-injury-compatibility</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"75703316b975a2ec\" href=\"?note=75703316b975a2ec\" title=\"68-df-finite-injury\">68-df-finite-injury</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_location","html":"not a theorem stated in supplied PDF; local verification lemma inspired by §15.5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-conditional-lemma-proved"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"local-induction-reviewed"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(1).zip; local content, type, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\">\\(R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjury}\">\\(\\mathrm{FinInjury}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RE}\">\\(\\mathrm{RE}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0d2eafa7efbe1e51\" href=\"?note=0d2eafa7efbe1e51\" title=\"68-df-finite-injury-compatibility\">68-df-finite-injury-compatibility</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"75703316b975a2ec\" href=\"?note=75703316b975a2ec\" title=\"68-df-finite-injury\">68-df-finite-injury</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"913d52943499d039\" href=\"?note=913d52943499d039\" title=\"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set\">68-df-recursively-enumerable-set</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}(A,R,a,b)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\nA\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\mathrm{FinInjury}(b)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A\\in R(e)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}(A,R,a,b)\\;\\Longrightarrow\\;\nA\\in\\mathrm{RE}\\land\\mathrm{FinInjury}(b)\\land\\forall e\\in\\mathbb N\\;(A\\in R(e)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是明确逐策略义务后的本地验证引理，不是原书陈述的无条件“有限伤害方法定理”。证明：对 e 归纳。e=0 无较高策略，兼容性给出其有限行动与要求满足。若每个 i&lt;e 行动有限次，有限并集中的全部较高行动也有限，故 e 此后不再受伤，兼容性再次给出 e 的有限行动和要求满足。于是所有策略有限伤害且全部要求成立。A 为统一递归有限集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_{a,s}\">\\(A_{a,s}\\)</span> 的并，故 x∈A 等价于存在阶段 s≥x 使 a(s,x)=1，是 c.e. 条件。</p>\n<p>保留遗留限制：本引理没有构造任意要求族所需策略，也没有证明任何给定构造满足兼容性；使用者必须给出这些局部证明。原文件声称由最终阶段满足推出 c.e. 极限满足，原假设不足，不能据本次条件化修订宣称完整有限伤害方法已经形式化。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-finite-injury-compatibility","status":"resolved","id":"0d2eafa7efbe1e51","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury-compatibility]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-finite-injury","status":"resolved","id":"75703316b975a2ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-finite-injury]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursively-enumerable-set","status":"resolved","id":"913d52943499d039","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-finite-injury-compatibility","status":"resolved","id":"0d2eafa7efbe1e51","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$，$R:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(\\mathbb N))$，$a:\\mathbb N^2\\to\\{0,1\\}$，$b:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{FinInjuryCompatible}$、$\\mathrm{FinInjury}$、$\\mathrm{RE}$ 分别见 [[68-df-finite-injury-compatibility]]、[[68-df-finite-injury]]、[[68-df-recursively-enumerable-set]]。","embed":false},{"tar